# Provenance: licensing-diagnostic.yml run 34590072272 (2026-09-11), PROBE 1
# and PROBE 2 on Unity 2020.3.49f1 - the licensing-client route, which 2020.3's
# 1.12.1 client cannot use for Personal seats because --include-personal does
# not exist in it. Trimmed to the licensing lines.
#
# The trap this fixture exists to catch is "Activation processed successfully."
# followed by exit code 0. The client exits 0 for a request it *processed*, not
# one it granted, and "No seat available" is the actual outcome - which is why
# a pass must be taken from positive evidence rather than from the absence of a
# failure or a zero exit status.
